{"title":"Woolly Mammoth","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 52 Mammoth that attacks with crush (melee). It will not attack first.</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"tag-chip weak\">slash</span><span class=\"tag-chip weak\">burn</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 15% damage (the game's own rule). Monsters have no resistances.</p>\n      \n      \n      <h2>Levels</h2><div class=\"q-picker\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Level\"><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/woolly-mammoth\">All levels</a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/woolly-mammoth?lv=52\">Lv 52 <span>2</span></a><a class=\"q-chip on\" href=\"#/monster/woolly-mammoth?lv=53\">Lv 53 <span>2</span></a></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">The same monster spawns at different levels, and its hitpoints, damage and XP follow its level (the game’s own formula). In the game a monster more than 5 levels above you shows its level as “???”.</p>\n      <div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-table\"><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>HP</th><th>Damage</th><th>XP</th><th>Elite (HP · dmg · XP)</th><th>Seen</th><th>Mostly</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/woolly-mammoth?lv=52\" title=\"Pick level 52\"><td><b>52</b> <span class=\"muted\">(base)</span></td><td>330</td><td>33.1</td><td>2,600</td><td class=\"muted\">990 · 46.3 · 7,800</td><td>2</td><td>in the wilds around 511, -837</td></tr><tr class=\"q-row-on\" data-href=\"#/monster/woolly-mammoth\" title=\"Show all levels\"><td><b>53</b></td><td>344</td><td>33.7</td><td>2,650</td><td class=\"muted\">1,032 · 47.2 · 7,950</td><td>2</td><td>in the wilds around 537, -810</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"monster\" data-map-id=\"woolly-mammoth\" data-map-level=\"53\">Show level 53 on the map</button>\n      \n      \n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-extra collector-monster-drops\"><b>Observed drops</b><div class=\"muted\">No drops recorded for this monster yet.</div></div>\n      \n      <h2>Where to find it</h2><figure class=\"wp-inset\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"wp-inset-map\" style=\"transform:translate(-3708.2px,374.9px)\"><img src=\"wtiles/1/13/-2.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:3328px;top:-512px\"><img src=\"wtiles/1/13/-1.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:3328px;top:-256px\"><img src=\"wtiles/1/14/-2.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:3584px;top:-512px\"><img src=\"wtiles/1/14/-1.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:3584px;top:-256px\"><img src=\"wtiles/1/15/-2.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:3840px;top:-512px\"><img src=\"wtiles/1/15/-1.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:3840px;top:-256px\"><i style=\"left:3715.0px;top:-440.1px\"></i><i style=\"left:3712.2px;top:-350.7px\"></i><i style=\"left:3704.3px;top:-399.0px\"></i></div></figure><ul class=\"wp-list\"><li>in the wilds around 537, -811 <span class=\"muted\">· 2 spots</span></li><li>in the wilds around 515, -836 <span class=\"muted\">· 1 spot</span></li></ul><button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"monster\" data-map-id=\"woolly-mammoth\">Show on map</button>\n      \n      <h2>Related</h2><p>Other Mammoth: <a href=\"#/monster/tundra-mammoth\">Tundra Mammoth</a> <span class=\"muted\">(50)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/mammoth-bull\">Mammoth Bull</a> <span class=\"muted\">(53)</span></p>\n      <p class=\"wp-guides\"><b>Guides:</b> <a href=\"#/guide/combat\">Combat</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monster-families\">Monster families</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monsters-by-level\">Monsters by level</a></p>\n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic\"><img src=\"data/img/gen/cd48b20711ca3943ce09.svg\" alt=\"Woolly Mammoth\"></div><h3>Woolly Mammoth</h3><table>\n      <tr><th>Level</th><td><b>53</b> <span class=\"muted\">(picked · base 52)</span></td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Family</th><td>Mammoth</td></tr><tr><th>Attacks</th><td>crush · melee</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Hitpoints</t